  "correct": "1.05",
  "solution": "Gọi tên các đỉnh như hình vẽ dưới đây, khi đó để diện tích mặt ngang lớn nhất thì diện tích của hình thang cân <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lớn nhất\n\t\tTrước hết ta dễ thấy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>cm.\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/3a9c7c26f3a9082a4ae9fafc7b11de1153f08b8f87664c77eb5a2298d7192bb8.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTa có \n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tCó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, thay vào (1) ta được<br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, đây là một hàm số theo biến <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>θ</mi></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tXét hàm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>\n\t\tCó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>cos</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>\n\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>\t\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>cos</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>θ</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tLập bảng biến thiên của hàm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trên nửa khoảng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> dễ thấy\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>max</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></munder><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy để diện tích mặt ngang <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>S</mi></semantics></math> lớn nhất khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>05</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
